{"id":"e0e3f6d67f68f8d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-stability.md","title":"Stability","display":"df-stability — Stability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stability","aliases":["58-df-stability"],"display":"df-stability — Stability","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-stable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stability — Stability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc5366796483404a\" href=\"?note=dc5366796483404a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-stable.md\">../batch16/58-df-stable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi,x_0,X,d\\in V\">\\(\\Phi,x_0,X,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\">\\(\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\\)</span> (Lyapunov-stability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc5366796483404a\" href=\"?note=dc5366796483404a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-stable.md\">../batch16/58-df-stable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V\\)</span> (precise predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stability\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_S(x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi,X,d\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Stable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stability\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_S(x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi,X,d\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Stable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The four-argument core retains the semiflow, carrier, and metric required by the upstream Lyapunov-stability predicate.</li>\n<li>This is Lyapunov stability for an equilibrium.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-stable.md","status":"resolved","id":"dc5366796483404a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-stable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-stable.md","status":"resolved","id":"dc5366796483404a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)$ (Lyapunov-stability predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-stable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi,x_0,X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LyapunovStable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stability\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_S(x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi,X,d\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Stable}_S(\\Phi,x_0,X,d)","display":true}],"bytes":980,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-stability.md|58-df-stability]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["dc5366796483404a"]}